WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:21.114
Deai wa kitto kokoro no yoake

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
Atarashii kaze ga soko kara umareru

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Hitori ja nai to kizuita toki ni

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
Tsukitooru tsuki wa hohemi wo kureru

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Sono toki tamashii ni kikoeru prelude wa

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Natsukashikute, tada fushigi na uta

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Hito wa minna

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Dareka to deau tame umarete kuru, kitto

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, hateshinai kono sekai e

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Sou, ai wo sagasu tame ni

01:42.164 --> 01:47.074
The current talks will be attended
by the President herself,

01:47.074 --> 01:50.664
a move seen as pursuing some form
of concession from the lunar kingdom.

01:51.074 --> 01:56.374
Opinion is strong that further development
could be difficult. Comments?

01:56.374 --> 01:57.744
We understand the lunar kingdom's arguments,

01:57.744 --> 01:59.244
Emergency
Meeting
We understand the lunar kingdom's arguments,

01:59.244 --> 02:04.424
Emergency
Meeting
but at this rate, shortages in food
and resources threaten to topple us both.

02:05.184 --> 02:10.694
We need to set aside the past and find
a point of compromise with due haste,

02:10.694 --> 02:11.684
or in the very near future...

02:13.064 --> 02:16.224
We absolutely cannot accept
these Terran demands!

02:16.804 --> 02:20.864
Our President has voluntarily
attended these talks!

02:21.174 --> 02:23.004
Don't you think you're being rude?!

02:23.004 --> 02:26.444
Rude, schmude. Next time, you can all
take yourselves to the Moon.

02:26.444 --> 02:28.964
S-such insolence!

02:29.514 --> 02:33.274
It's not as if we had any interest in this meeting.

02:33.484 --> 02:35.284
You say something like that NOW?!

02:35.284 --> 02:37.014
Now, now.

02:37.084 --> 02:39.224
That's enough, the both of you.

02:39.224 --> 02:42.884
The only thing that should be hot
is this tea. All right?

02:53.404 --> 02:55.924
Excellent work, Madam President.

02:56.104 --> 02:59.164
Still, this is a tough one, isn't it?

03:00.214 --> 03:02.644
Oh my. What's this?

03:02.644 --> 03:05.674
Ma'am. The top secret file I mentioned earlier.

03:06.744 --> 03:10.184
This is not an Earth vessel, is it?

03:11.084 --> 03:12.924
A lunar recon ship?

03:12.924 --> 03:14.424
We have no information.

03:14.424 --> 03:19.414
By the way, how's Princess Feena doing?
I understand she was at the beach recently.

03:19.624 --> 03:22.434
Yes. She greatly enjoyed it.

03:22.434 --> 03:24.834
We're fighting with the Moon right now,

03:24.834 --> 03:29.934
but a successful homestay could have
a positive effect on the negotiations.

03:30.644 --> 03:32.104
We're counting on you.

03:32.104 --> 03:32.934
Yes, ma'am.

03:37.114 --> 03:38.584
- Episode 6-
The Princess is Forbidden
to Fall in Love?!

03:38.584 --> 03:41.354
- Episode 6-
The Princess is Forbidden
to Fall in Love?!
The Princess is Forbidden
to Fall in Love?!

03:41.354 --> 03:43.084
- Episode 6-
The Princess is Forbidden
to Fall in Love?!

03:45.184 --> 03:48.054
Feena, you've really become a pro
at this, haven't you?

03:48.424 --> 03:51.664
It's enough to want you here every day!

03:51.664 --> 03:57.094
What are you saying? Feena has her
other duties as a princess.

03:57.164 --> 04:01.134
You're right. Also, if Feena came every day,

04:01.134 --> 04:04.144
Natsuki would have nothing to do and get fired...

04:04.144 --> 04:05.694
Sorry!

04:05.874 --> 04:05.904
With Thoughts
of Big Brother

04:05.904 --> 04:10.114
With Thoughts
of Big Brother
YOU'RE the one who'll get fired if you try
and get out of doing your work!

04:10.114 --> 04:11.384
With Thoughts
of Big Brother
Tatsu! Can I have you do the shopping for me?

04:11.384 --> 04:13.654
Tatsu! Can I have you do the shopping for me?

04:13.654 --> 04:15.154
Yes, sir.

04:15.154 --> 04:17.154
There's sort of a lot though...

04:17.154 --> 04:18.184
All right.

04:18.184 --> 04:20.244
Shall I help?

04:21.024 --> 04:23.894
Let's see, we haven't forgotten anything, right?

04:23.894 --> 04:25.824
No. This is the last of it.

04:25.824 --> 04:28.994
Anyway, Jin really is a handful, isn't he?

04:38.844 --> 04:39.894
Feena?

04:40.344 --> 04:41.744
I'm sorry.

04:43.714 --> 04:45.274
Hang on a minute.

04:47.784 --> 04:49.044
Tatsuya?

04:49.814 --> 04:51.544
Welcome!

04:54.124 --> 04:55.714
This is...

04:56.294 --> 04:57.624
I can't.

04:57.624 --> 05:01.594
But you've been wanting that
for a while now, right?

05:01.594 --> 05:05.154
I merely liked it because I thought it was cute.

05:07.774 --> 05:11.104
Also, I couldn't have you
do something like this for me.

05:11.574 --> 05:15.844
I just want to give it to you. Is that wrong?

05:16.874 --> 05:18.364
Tatsuya...

05:24.984 --> 05:26.684
Thank you, Tatsuya.

05:32.794 --> 05:34.314
Wreathlit.

05:34.964 --> 05:37.194
Miss Fiacca?

05:37.734 --> 05:40.534
You understand, do you not?

05:41.134 --> 05:45.234
What will happen if the Moon and Earth
draw closer unpreparedly...

05:46.604 --> 05:49.944
That is what we must prevent.

05:50.914 --> 05:52.034
Yes, ma'am.

05:54.314 --> 05:59.614
Thank you, Tatsuya.
Doing this is so kind of you...

06:00.124 --> 06:03.554
It makes me want to do
something for you as well.

06:03.694 --> 06:06.714
Th-that's okay! I just...

06:07.534 --> 06:10.494
Feena? Hey, F-Feena. Feena!

06:12.864 --> 06:14.964
Ow...

06:17.374 --> 06:19.134
A dream, huh?

06:21.014 --> 06:22.304
Oh no!

06:24.284 --> 06:26.684
Brother sure is late this morning.

06:26.684 --> 06:29.044
Do we not have to wake him?

06:29.184 --> 06:32.844
Please don't worry yourself over it.
He'll be up soon enough.

06:36.154 --> 06:37.884
Speak of the devil.

06:38.164 --> 06:39.994
Morning!

06:39.994 --> 06:43.294
How unusual for you to sleep in, Mr. Tatsuya.

06:43.394 --> 06:46.564
Are you still on summer vacation schedule?

06:46.564 --> 06:49.834
It's already been two weeks
since we've been back at school.

06:49.834 --> 06:53.104
No, that's not it. I just sort of...

06:56.274 --> 06:58.784
This is... Um, it seemed a shame not to use it.

06:58.784 --> 07:00.544
Y-yeah.

07:03.954 --> 07:06.054
This here is the point.

07:06.054 --> 07:10.094
A tremendous amount of money was invested
to construct the Mitsurugasaki central port,

07:10.094 --> 07:15.194
and to simultaneously construct
the neighboring cities as well.

07:16.094 --> 07:19.194
The details of this urban development
program are right here.

07:19.404 --> 07:24.944
Next, be sure to look over the plan for
the Lunar-Terran administrative body!

07:24.944 --> 07:25.834
At the time...

07:30.614 --> 07:32.144
Sorry!

07:32.144 --> 07:34.444
It's fine. I just finished.

07:36.154 --> 07:37.384
Feena! That's...

07:41.824 --> 07:42.794
I'm sorry!

07:45.064 --> 07:46.084
I'll be going now!

08:02.444 --> 08:03.814
Say, Midori.

08:04.444 --> 08:07.514
Recently, Tatsuya and Feena have...

08:07.514 --> 08:09.584
Asagiri and Feena?! Huh?

08:09.584 --> 08:12.054
What, what, what, what?
Did something happen between them?

08:14.594 --> 08:19.564
Uh, never mind. From your reaction,
it looks like you haven't noticed.

08:19.564 --> 08:22.764
Hey, what gives?! Tell me!

08:22.764 --> 08:28.634
Just forget about it! Okay, I have to
hurry home to help out at the shop!

08:29.074 --> 08:30.294
Hey!

08:38.084 --> 08:39.174
Um!

08:44.284 --> 08:45.984
Uh, Feena?

08:46.224 --> 08:47.554
Yes?

08:47.724 --> 08:49.714
Um, well...

08:57.094 --> 08:58.224
Thank you!

09:01.504 --> 09:03.004
It's delicious!

09:03.004 --> 09:07.204
It is? Maybe I should have gotten that instead.

09:09.474 --> 09:11.444
Here. Have some if you like.

09:13.144 --> 09:14.544
Feena...

09:16.754 --> 09:18.044
Well...

09:19.124 --> 09:20.854
Tatsuya! Your ice cream!

09:31.364 --> 09:32.894
It's cold.

09:34.604 --> 09:36.834
That was a bit of a blunder, Tatsuya...

09:36.834 --> 09:38.704
I'm really sorry.

09:39.174 --> 09:43.174
Please forgive him. We can wash your cap soon.

09:43.174 --> 09:47.174
Oh, speaking of, our house's
washing machine is acting up.

09:48.014 --> 09:49.714
Mia said so last night.

09:49.714 --> 09:51.054
Wreathlit.
Oh, really?

09:51.854 --> 09:58.284
Use whatever means are necessary.
Prevent these two from becoming any closer!

09:58.764 --> 09:59.694
What is it?

09:59.694 --> 10:03.894
It's just, it feels like a while
since I've talked to you like this.

10:04.104 --> 10:05.864
Yes, I feel the same...

10:10.674 --> 10:11.464
Look out!

10:11.574 --> 10:12.374
Tatsuya!

10:19.784 --> 10:21.544
Are you both all right?

10:22.014 --> 10:24.784
Yeah. It looks like she's not hurt.

10:24.784 --> 10:26.224
Thank goodness.

10:29.324 --> 10:31.854
You can't just space out like that.

10:42.034 --> 10:43.404
Please, O sister!

10:43.404 --> 10:46.244
Just lend me 5,600 yen... No, 10,000 yen!

10:46.244 --> 10:47.534
Go away!

10:48.474 --> 10:51.114
If this is how it's going to be, O sister, then fine!

10:51.114 --> 10:54.954
I'll just eat your carbonized food
and die a heroic death as a result!

10:54.954 --> 10:56.184
Sorry about this, Wreath!

10:56.184 --> 10:59.414
Quit saying such nasty things!

11:01.424 --> 11:04.514
Oh! Heroic death!

11:09.134 --> 11:12.254
Jin! You just keep racking up
the debts, don't you?

11:12.604 --> 11:14.264
Ah! Welcome back!

11:15.774 --> 11:19.804
I swear. When will Jin actually get a paycheck?

11:19.804 --> 11:21.034
Indeed.

11:26.214 --> 11:29.374
That's the dishwasher!

11:33.554 --> 11:36.454
Sorry for the bother Tatsuya's caused you.

11:37.494 --> 11:39.194
That's fine.

11:39.194 --> 11:45.034
U-um, please drink this! Our way of
saying "Sorry." It's on the house!

11:47.734 --> 11:49.374
I'm sorry, Tatsuya.

11:49.374 --> 11:52.244
It's okay. I'm just glad we noticed
before you put it in!

11:52.244 --> 11:56.704
Still, mistaking a dishwasher
for a washing machine is just...

12:00.044 --> 12:01.814
You don't have to laugh so much about it.

12:01.814 --> 12:03.754
Ah! Sorry, sorry!

12:06.654 --> 12:08.284
Ow...

12:13.624 --> 12:14.754
Klutz.

12:15.494 --> 12:16.654
Here.

12:22.634 --> 12:24.004
Thank you.

12:24.504 --> 12:30.074
Her cap will be all clean soon.
May she stay here until it's ready?

12:30.074 --> 12:33.374
Sure. Dad already gave his permission.

12:34.484 --> 12:36.214
Do you not like the juice?

12:42.824 --> 12:45.164
Perhaps she's hungry.

12:45.164 --> 12:47.694
Ah! So that's why she's not talking.

12:47.694 --> 12:49.684
No, I don't think that's-

12:53.504 --> 12:58.304
I-I'll have my father make you
something, okay? Dad!

12:58.304 --> 13:00.334
That was really perceptive of you, Feena.

13:01.314 --> 13:02.444
It was just coincidence.

13:02.444 --> 13:05.774
And yet, why do you mistake a dishwasher
for a washing machine?

13:06.214 --> 13:08.684
Oh, stop talking about...

13:09.284 --> 13:12.584
This all happened because you got her cap dirty!

13:12.584 --> 13:13.254
Ah! You're right.

13:13.254 --> 13:14.244
This is dangerous.
Ah! You're right.

13:30.234 --> 13:33.644
Incredible, Miss Mai! You're so talented!

13:33.644 --> 13:36.164
Don't exaggerate, Mia.

13:37.374 --> 13:41.314
That was the first time you've allowed me
to hear you play. It was wonderful!

13:41.314 --> 13:45.314
When I practice, I usually do it down by the river.

13:45.584 --> 13:48.784
My brother used to go with me all the time.

13:49.054 --> 13:51.024
Really? Mr. Tatsuya did?

13:51.294 --> 13:57.064
But recently, he won't go at all.
I guess it makes me a little lonely.

13:57.064 --> 13:59.264
I understand how you feel!

13:59.504 --> 14:06.164
These days, my chances to accompany
the Princess have become somewhat fewer...

14:06.604 --> 14:08.144
Say, Mia?

14:08.144 --> 14:09.044
Yes?

14:09.044 --> 14:13.004
Don't you think my brother and Feena
are acting strange lately?

14:13.684 --> 14:16.014
Mr. Tatsuya and Madam Feena?

14:16.214 --> 14:20.054
It's just sort of a vague feeling...

14:20.554 --> 14:26.514
How dare you sully the Princess of the
Moon with your touch?! Kill them all!

14:33.264 --> 14:36.634
What is it, Miss Mai? Miss Mai!

14:37.334 --> 14:40.634
Get a hold of yourself, Miss Mai!
Are you all right?

14:41.874 --> 14:43.344
Welcome!

14:44.074 --> 14:45.744
Order up!

14:45.744 --> 14:46.904
Okay!

14:47.384 --> 14:48.854
Sorry to keep you waiting.

14:48.854 --> 14:50.414
Um, let's see...

14:50.414 --> 14:53.524
Tatsuya, have those customers
over there ordered?

14:53.524 --> 14:55.154
Oh no! Not yet!

14:55.154 --> 14:57.324
Then I shall do it.

14:57.324 --> 14:59.884
Really? Feena, you're a pro!

15:07.004 --> 15:08.494
Do you do that, too?

15:13.404 --> 15:15.534
You understand all too well, yes?

15:16.014 --> 15:18.984
At this rate, the two of them shall draw near.

15:20.714 --> 15:25.284
It would mean the destruction
of both the Moon and the Earth.

15:25.284 --> 15:28.154
That tragedy must not be repeated.

15:34.934 --> 15:36.534
Um, Boss?

15:36.534 --> 15:37.394
My disciple!

15:37.394 --> 15:38.264
Y-yes, sir?

15:38.264 --> 15:40.874
Begin doing 1,000 squats in three seconds!

15:40.874 --> 15:41.924
Yes, Boss!

15:54.584 --> 15:55.914
Welcom...

15:56.414 --> 15:57.514
Huh?

16:15.374 --> 16:17.394
Return, Wreath.

16:18.774 --> 16:24.374
We have a task we must fulfill.
Do not dwell on the unimportant.

16:40.594 --> 16:41.924
Let's eat!

16:42.164 --> 16:43.654
Let's eat!

16:46.064 --> 16:47.794
It's delicious!

16:49.734 --> 16:51.834
Are you all right, Feena?

16:53.304 --> 16:54.674
That girl...

16:54.674 --> 16:56.204
"That girl"?

16:56.314 --> 16:59.674
The girl, Wreath... She was here earlier.

17:00.284 --> 17:03.684
But it looks like she went home
without saying anything.

17:03.814 --> 17:06.284
Perhaps she was angry after all.

17:06.284 --> 17:10.924
It's nothing for you to feel bad about, Feena.
It was my fault to begin with.

17:10.924 --> 17:16.694
But she may have grown to hate me
without my realizing it.

17:18.834 --> 17:22.304
I've come to notice something recently.

17:22.304 --> 17:28.174
No matter where I find myself,
I always end up thinking like a princess.

17:29.214 --> 17:33.244
Tatsuya, Natsuki, I'm sure I've offended you
on numerous occasions.

17:33.244 --> 17:38.684
No, not at all! I've never
thought of you that way, Feena!

17:38.824 --> 17:42.314
That's right! Even my brother...

17:53.404 --> 17:55.874
What will you do, Madam Princess?

17:56.274 --> 17:59.674
Shall you give this insolent commoner
the death sentence?

18:00.244 --> 18:01.404
The death sentence?!

18:01.674 --> 18:03.074
Of course not.

18:03.074 --> 18:04.804
You wouldn't, would you?

18:05.644 --> 18:07.974
FEENA wouldn't. Never.

18:11.754 --> 18:13.314
Tatsuya...

18:29.204 --> 18:31.864
FEENA wouldn't. Never.

18:34.544 --> 18:37.914
What am I doing?!

18:43.684 --> 18:45.084
Feena...

18:46.754 --> 18:47.744
Yes?

18:49.824 --> 18:51.414
Sis?

18:52.164 --> 18:54.284
Tatsuya, do you have a minute?

18:55.534 --> 18:56.524
I guess.

18:56.734 --> 18:59.034
I want to talk to you about something.

19:02.234 --> 19:04.404
What do you want to talk about?

19:04.404 --> 19:06.274
About Feena.

19:07.144 --> 19:12.544
We have a huge responsibility, providing
the homestay for the lunar princess.

19:12.984 --> 19:15.274
You know that, don't you?

19:16.214 --> 19:17.544
Yeah, but...

19:18.084 --> 19:22.544
Do you have feelings for Feena?

19:22.754 --> 19:26.264
Sis! Wh-what are you, all of a sudden?

19:26.264 --> 19:31.034
You ask me that out of the blue,
but I'm not prepared for it or...

19:31.034 --> 19:32.864
Answer honestly.

19:33.864 --> 19:37.574
Her Royal Highness Feena Fam Earthlight,
as a member of the lunar nobility,

19:37.574 --> 19:40.804
holds tremendous influence
in a number of areas.

19:41.344 --> 19:45.834
She has a great responsibility for all her actions,
whether public or private.

19:46.114 --> 19:47.514
Sis...

19:49.584 --> 19:54.244
Tatsuya, I'm worried about you.

19:56.894 --> 20:00.294
After all, I'm your big sister.

20:00.294 --> 20:01.284
So...

20:08.904 --> 20:10.704
It's all right, Sis.

20:11.444 --> 20:15.934
I don't think about Feena that way at all.

20:23.414 --> 20:25.184
Tatsuya...

20:30.354 --> 20:34.794
And when he dropped his ice cream,
he was so flustered!

20:34.794 --> 20:36.024
Madam Feena.

20:36.294 --> 20:37.734
Yes, Karen?

20:37.964 --> 20:42.194
You have been talking only about Tatsuya
for some time now.

20:43.234 --> 20:45.604
O-oh, I have?

20:47.404 --> 20:49.204
That is a cute mug.

20:50.974 --> 20:54.474
This was a present. From Tatsuya.

20:55.784 --> 20:59.654
It's cute and I've long cared for it,

20:59.654 --> 21:02.744
but I couldn't bring myself
to enter the store alone.

21:03.554 --> 21:06.924
When Tatsuya gave me this, I was so happy.

21:07.894 --> 21:09.454
Madam Feena.

21:09.734 --> 21:11.964
Tatsuya is an Earthling.

21:13.764 --> 21:17.794
And you, Madam Feena, are a lunar princess.

21:19.004 --> 21:23.464
I will say no more on the matter. However...

21:26.014 --> 21:27.484
I know.

21:28.514 --> 21:31.744
I'm a lunar princess...

22:09.094 --> 22:13.824
Platinum no mikazuki

22:13.824 --> 22:21.804
Ima funwari tatazunda

22:21.804 --> 22:29.074
Sora miagete omou

22:29.074 --> 22:39.554
Ano nagareboshi kitto tsuki no namida ne

22:39.554 --> 22:46.994
Soshite anata wo omotta

22:46.994 --> 22:55.104
Doushite watashi namida ga deru no

22:55.104 --> 23:03.014
Eien wo tada inotteiru noni

23:03.014 --> 23:11.014
Mirai wo shinji aruite itai

23:11.014 --> 23:23.264
Tsuki ga nankai michite wa kakete mo, anata to

23:25.164 --> 23:26.534
Preview

23:26.534 --> 23:28.674
Preview
Seeking to cast off the bonds of endearment
brings up so many emotions...

23:28.674 --> 23:30.874
Seeking to cast off the bonds of endearment
brings up so many emotions...

23:30.874 --> 23:33.434
And then, a sudden visitor.

23:33.704 --> 23:35.834
The pulse of those emotions now quickens.

23:36.314 --> 23:36.674
By the way, Jin, don't look at me so angrily!

23:36.674 --> 23:39.384
- Episode 7-
The Princess's Fiancé!
By the way, Jin, don't look at me so angrily!

23:39.384 --> 23:40.144
- Episode 7-
The Princess's Fiancé!
